@startuml
title P1 Store Compliance - Moderation and reviewer flows
actor Recipient
participant "Pulsar or Telegram surface" as Surface
participant "Moderation API" as API
database "Reports, blocks, audit" as DB
actor "Support" as Support

Recipient -> Surface : report media or block sender
Surface -> API : submit action
API -> DB : persist immutable report or block
API --> Surface : return reporter safe status
Support -> API : review report
API -> DB : load reporter, metadata, target scope and allowed evidence
Support -> API : choose no action or delete media or disable actor or disable orbit
API -> DB : apply action and append audit entry
API --> Surface : expose updated status without extra personal data

newpage
actor "Store reviewer" as Reviewer
participant "Acceptance harness" as Harness
participant "Store asset pack" as Pack
participant "Pulsar build" as Build

Reviewer -> Pack : follow certification notes
Reviewer -> Build : launch clean install
Reviewer -> Build : Try locally, builtin cue, microphone loopback
Reviewer -> Build : Create Barycenter, record clip, target This Pulsar
Build --> Reviewer : played receipt and visible history or settings path
Harness -> Pack : attach RU and EN listing copy, screenshots, IARC and notes
Harness -> Pack : attach A1 to A8 logs, timings, migration and rollback evidence
Pack --> Reviewer : self contained reviewer path with no Spotify or Telegram account
@enduml
